# Credentials. The live suites read AUTH_TOKEN from the environment and the token itself
# lives outside any repository (~/.yandex-auth-token, mode 600) — these patterns exist so
# that a copy made "just for a minute" cannot be committed by accident.
*.token
*auth-token*
*-token
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
*.pem
*.p12
